# SvelteKit frontend rules

- PoC UI lives in `frontend/researcher` only (no `frontend/citizen`).
- OpenAPI client: `frontend/researcher/src/lib/api` (generated from Rust API).
- SSR via `@sveltejs/adapter-node`; real-time via SSE (not WebSockets).
- UX reference: `docs/01-uiux-theory.md` — quiet default UI, explicit modes (Reading/Writing/Reviewing/Inspecting), suggestions identical for human and agent authors.
- English-only UI for PoC; data model keeps `Map<language, string>` for labels.
- After edits: `cd frontend/researcher && pnpm lint && pnpm check`.
